{"id": "Ugwe8krWvH4PFPxYLy94AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "이럴 영상 올리지마라. 시간낭비다", "published": "2026-10-25T12:40:32", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugyk2aFbs6bhtLSn2bB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "일본이 더 높지 않나요?", "published": "2026-10-26T22:05:02", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
